Hello friends!

Today we have another update for [b]Zombotron Re-Boot[/b] (Demo) which is aimed at increasing the stability and reducing the number of annoying bugs in the game to a minimum. In the new version we have added the ability to customize controls for keyboard, mouse and gamepads. And also the game now fully supports of [b]Steam Deck[/b]!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44740297/ef39b0b3429aa57e58f0f15c6fec2aa4ec8d3495.png[/img]

[b]What's new in 1.3.0[/b]

🔸 Improved gamepad support;
🔸 Improved keyboard and mouse support, now you can configure controls for keyboard, mouse and gamepads;
🔸 Added the ability to manually set the input type: keyboard, gamepad or sensor - this allows you to solve problems with auto-detection of the input type on some devices;
🔸 Added support for Portuguese language;
🔸 Added an option for the hero to self-destruct in hopeless situations ('B' key, L1+R1 or LT+RT buttons on the gamepads);
🔸 As well as other fixes and improvements that should make the game smoother and more enjoyable.

[b]What's new in 1.2.2[/b]

🔸 Enemies now dies when falling from a great height;
🔸 The problem of the livating hero when he got caught on walls and game objects has been fixed, due to this the responsiveness of the controls has been improved;
🔸 The camera zoom option has returned to the game settings; the functionality has been improved and now it works as it should;
🔸 Many known problems on game levels related to the incorrect revival of the hero or transition to other levels have been fixed;
🔸 Added support for new localizations: Polish, Hungarian, Serbian and Chinese.
🔸 As well as other minor fixes and improvements!

We are not planning any more updates for the demo version of the game (exclude bug fixes), which means we are switching to full-time work on the second chapter!

- Ant.

Hello,

Today there is a small update that mainly solves some previously identified problems and adds support for two new languages to the game.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44740297/fd56de794bc081b715d968f2397edf7dcbd0fe9d.png[/img]

[b]What's new in the version 1.2.0?[/b]

🔸 Added Harry to the game menu from whom you can find out some details;
🔸 Added support for Spanish language;
🔸 Added support for Turkish language;
🔸 [Mobile] Fixed an issue where the maximum screen refresh rate was not set;
🔸 [Mobile] Fixed an issue where the position of the on-screen joysticks;
🔸 [PC] Fixed a problem with incorrect display of texts;
🔸 Updated appearance of the main character;
🔸 Changed the balance for skeleton enemies;
🔸 As well other fixes!

[b]What's new in the version 1.1.0?[/b]

🔸 Added laser sight and auto aiming; 
🔸 Added control settings; 
🔸 Added the ability to skip the animation of the flight of the soul to the point of resurrection, improved the system of resurrections at levels; 
🔸 Changed, the hero can open chests and interact with buttons while reloading weapons; 
🔸 Fixed, when the hero stands close to enemies, bullets do not fly out behind them, but certainly hit the enemy; 
🔸 Also other great improvements and fixes! 

Currently I continue to work on implementing full support for gamepads and the ability to customize controls for PCs.

- Ant.

Almost three weeks have passed since the first release of the game, and in the first two weeks I managed to release four patches! To be honest, I didn’t expect you to like the game so much and especially didn’t expect you to break everything so quickly 🤷‍♂️

It seemed to me that the game was well debugged, but some “flaws” leaked into the finale. Moreover, I managed to do the most annoying of them at the very last moment.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44740297/c9e7e0a52b244ac78de763a694b2975bb7a3f8bc.png[/img]

Today there is a small list of changes for four patches at once:

Ver 1.0.1
🔸 [Mobile] Fixed an issue with the reload button disappearing.

Ver 1.0.2
🔸 Fixed a problem when several objects were destroyed at once during a mission and there were not enough harvested souls, which caused an error.
🔸 Fixed endless rebirth at level 9 if the hero immediately falls into a pit from the elevator.
🔸 Minor improvements across levels.

Ver 1.0.3
🔸 [Mobile] Added smoothness option (60 fps) to settings. You can reduce performance to reduce CPU load and save battery power;
🔸 Fixed, the option to disable hero phrases now disables all useless phrases. The hero’s informational phrases, for example, about not having enough money to buy something in a store, are not disabled.
🔸 Fixed, at level 9 if you fall from the elevator at the start of the level, after resurrection the invisible wall was not removed;
🔸 Fixed, at level 9 if the hero falls from the elevator, he dies 100%;
🔸 Fixed, at level 10, if you fall into a hole, the hero does not die and suffers alone until the level is restarted;
🔸 Fixed, if you quickly tap after death, the tap to respawn inscription remained and control disappeared.
🔸 Changed, completed calls are saved immediately when the level completion window appears and when this level is restarted they are considered completed.
🔸 [PC] Added, default jump to spacebar and W, attack to F.

Ver 1.0.4
🔸 Added a setting for bringing the camera closer to the game location (they say it doesn’t work very well, you’ll have to redo it);
🔸 Fixed the problem when the chest or magazine did not reset the weapon after restarting the game level (this problem took a toll on me, I built a whole conspiracy theory against me! But the reason, as usual, turned out to be banal);
🔸 Fixed that if you take another weapon while reloading, the hero no longer wanted to shoot;
🔸 Fixed spamming of attacks and shots if you quickly press the attack button;
🔸 Changed the character's falling speed;
🔸 Improved display of results in the level completion window;
🔸 Improved tablet support (interface adaptation);
🔸 As well as some other fixes and improvements both in levels and within the game.

The next big task: to make gamepad control even better and give the ability to customize it. Task with a star! ⭐️
